' BLE sequence, part A: advertising window, connect, discovery, schedule read.
' Message order follows firmware/src/ble_sched.c (on_ble_evt, on_authorize, ble_sched_poll),
' SDK nrf_ble_gatt.c, and web/app.js (connect). Part B: ble-sequence-b.puml.
' Render: README.md, section Render.
@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Serif
skinparam noteFontName DejaVu Serif
skinparam dpi 160
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
autonumber

participant "Strona\nWWW" as Web
participant "Przeglądarka\ni BLE OS" as Br
participant "SoftDevice\nS112" as SD
participant "ble_sched.c\n(SWI2)" as Isr
participant "pętla\ngłówna" as Loop
participant "alarm.c" as Store

== Rozgłaszanie ==
Loop -> SD : przycisk 2 s, brak alarmu: adv_start (100 ms, 60 s)
SD -> Br : ADV_IND „ShakeClock”, SCAN_RSP z UUID

== Połączenie ==
Web -> Br : requestDevice, wybór, gatt.connect()
Br -> SD : CONNECT_IND
SD -> Isr : GAP_EVT_CONNECTED → s_ev_connect
SD <-> Br : wymiana MTU (do 247)
Loop -> Loop : ble_sched_poll: limit 60 s
Web -> SD : odkrycie usługi i charakterystyki (SoftDevice sam)

== Odczyt rozkładu ==
Web -> SD : readValue(): ATT Read Request
SD -> Isr : RW_AUTHORIZE_REQUEST (odczyt)
Isr -> Store : alarm_table_get()
Isr -> SD : sched_encode, authorize_reply (113 B)
SD -> Web : ATT Read Response → decode()
@enduml
